"<div id=""mindx-pt-checklist"">

  <h2>Psychology Today Profile Checklist</h2>

  <div class=""subtitle"">
    A practical checklist for creating a clear, professional profile
    that helps the right clients find and connect with you.
  </div>

  <div class=""progress-box"">

    <div class=""progress-top"">
      <span>Profile Progress</span>
      <strong id=""progressText"">0 / 27</strong>
    </div>

    <div class=""progress-track"">
      <div class=""progress-bar"" id=""progressBar""></div>
    </div>

  </div>


  <!-- PROFILE BASICS -->

  <div class=""category"">

    <h3>1. Profile Basics</h3>

    <p class=""category-description"">
      Make a strong first impression and clearly communicate who you are.
    </p>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Professional profile photo</strong>
        <small>
          Use a recent, clear, well-lit photo that looks approachable
          and reflects how you present yourself professionally.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Name and credentials are accurate</strong>
        <small>
          Include your full professional name, license type, and relevant
          credentials or certifications.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Clear headline</strong>
        <small>
          Use a concise statement that communicates who you help and
          what you help with rather than simply listing your job title.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Bio sounds like you</strong>
        <small>
          Write in accessible language that feels personal and welcoming
          rather than reading like a résumé.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>License information is current</strong>
        <small>
          Review your license type, state, and other professional
          information for accuracy.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

  </div>


  <!-- SPECIALTIES -->

  <div class=""category"">

    <h3>2. Specialties & Areas of Focus</h3>

    <p class=""category-description"">
      Help prospective clients quickly determine whether you are a good fit.
    </p>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Specific specialties selected</strong>
        <small>
          Choose specific areas you genuinely work with rather than
          relying primarily on broad or generic categories.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Top specialties reflect your ideal clients</strong>
        <small>
          Make sure your most prominent areas of focus match the
          clients you want to attract.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Populations are accurate</strong>
        <small>
          Review the age groups and populations you indicate that
          you work with.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Niche areas are clearly represented</strong>
        <small>
          Include relevant niche concerns or populations when they
          meaningfully describe your practice.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

  </div>


  <!-- CLIENT FIT -->

  <div class=""category"">

    <h3>3. Client Fit & Services</h3>

    <p class=""category-description"">
      Give prospective clients enough information to determine whether
      your services fit their needs.
    </p>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Types of services are clear</strong>
        <small>
          Clearly indicate whether you offer individual, couples,
          family, or other types of counseling.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>Telehealth availability is accurate</strong>
        <small>
          Clearly communicate whether you offer online counseling
          and where you are authorized to provide it.
        </small>
      </span>
    </label>

    <label class=""check-item"">
      <input type=""checkbox"">
      <span>
        <strong>In-person availability is accurate</strong>
        <small>
          Make sure your location and in-person availability are
